WEBVTT

01:33.040 --> 01:36.160
OUR GENERATION

01:36.200 --> 01:39.180
EPISODE 6

01:39.220 --> 01:40.500
QIN FAMILY MART, GENERAL GOODS

01:40.540 --> 01:42.100
Lin Yingtao, are you out of your mind?

01:42.140 --> 01:44.120
You went that far for Jiang Qiaoxi?

01:44.160 --> 01:46.960
I already told you, it wasn't for him.

01:47.560 --> 01:49.100
It was for the kitten.

01:49.800 --> 01:51.080
It was all white,

01:51.120 --> 01:52.360
all cute, right?

01:55.840 --> 01:57.140
Stop making excuses.

01:57.880 --> 01:59.640
Even if you care about animals,

01:59.680 --> 02:00.940
you can't deny

02:00.980 --> 02:02.080
that kitten meant

02:02.120 --> 02:04.100
something different
because of Jiang Qiaoxi.

02:07.660 --> 02:08.960
I… I didn't come here

02:09.000 --> 02:10.259
for a lecture.

02:14.260 --> 02:15.820
Just help me find a clean shirt.

02:15.860 --> 02:17.100
If my mom sees me like this,

02:17.140 --> 02:18.660
she'll be worried again.

02:20.840 --> 02:22.220
Grab the one we bought together,

02:22.260 --> 02:23.680
the matching set.

02:24.820 --> 02:26.320
Right now,

02:26.360 --> 02:27.360
what you really need

02:27.400 --> 02:28.640
is to get a straight answer

02:28.680 --> 02:29.740
from Jiang Qiaoxi.

02:30.420 --> 02:31.500
Does he still want to be

02:31.540 --> 02:32.880
friends with you, like the old days?

02:33.420 --> 02:35.200
If he keeps acting hot and cold,

02:35.240 --> 02:36.380
then tell him to back off.

02:37.520 --> 02:38.620
You stay away from him too.

02:40.560 --> 02:41.980
I have been staying away.

02:42.020 --> 02:43.460
I've kept my distance for long enough.

02:44.160 --> 02:45.340
Why are you yelling at me?

02:46.100 --> 02:47.860
If you've got the guts,
go yell at Jiang Qiaoxi.

02:49.120 --> 02:49.960
All bark, no bite.

03:03.880 --> 03:05.300
Wanna grab some breakfast?

03:23.380 --> 03:24.240
Jiang Qiaoxi.

03:25.060 --> 03:28.000
What exactly is Lin Yingtao to you?
A friend?

03:30.400 --> 03:32.000
I don't get it.

03:34.160 --> 03:35.400
Don't play dumb.

03:36.220 --> 03:37.820
Aren't you besties with Cen Xiaoman now,

03:38.400 --> 03:39.640
leaving Yingtao all behind?

03:40.240 --> 03:42.340
Definitely not. How could I?

03:45.400 --> 03:46.680
Yeah, whatever.

03:47.200 --> 03:48.140
Wait.

03:48.880 --> 03:49.720
So

03:50.520 --> 03:51.880
does Yingtao think that too?

03:57.060 --> 03:58.320
You should go after her.

03:58.360 --> 03:59.860
It'll be hard to explain at school.

03:59.900 --> 04:01.000
She can't have gone far.

04:12.920 --> 04:14.120
Jiang Qiaoxi!

04:14.160 --> 04:16.700
- Jiang Qiaoxi!
- Uncle, we switched rides.

04:17.320 --> 04:18.160
You did?

04:26.060 --> 04:26.900
Yingtao!

04:31.860 --> 04:32.920
Yingtao!

04:33.420 --> 04:35.040
I haven't changed!

04:35.920 --> 04:38.000
I still want to be your good friend!

04:39.840 --> 04:41.020
Yingtao!

04:42.880 --> 04:43.880
Yingtao!

04:45.420 --> 04:46.560
Yingtao!

04:52.260 --> 04:53.160
Stop chasing!

05:31.840 --> 05:32.920
Jiang Qiaoxi.

05:52.040 --> 05:53.160
What are you even doing?

05:53.900 --> 05:56.520
Do you know how dangerous that was?

05:56.560 --> 05:57.500
You are reckless.

06:00.680 --> 06:01.560
And you're laughing?

06:01.600 --> 06:02.580
Are you stupid?

06:02.620 --> 06:04.000
That was seriously dangerous.

06:09.760 --> 06:10.840
Stop laughing.

06:10.880 --> 06:11.920
What do you want?

06:14.320 --> 06:15.160
Yingtao…

06:18.580 --> 06:19.420
I'm sorry.

06:40.840 --> 06:41.680
Let me give you a ride.

06:46.820 --> 06:47.920
Who wants a ride from you?

07:28.520 --> 07:29.900
If you're ready to talk,

07:30.880 --> 07:31.720
then say it.

07:33.020 --> 07:34.320
Why didn't you contact me

07:34.360 --> 07:35.320
all those years?

07:35.960 --> 07:36.940
It all started

07:38.700 --> 07:40.420
that winter break

07:40.460 --> 07:42.160
when I came back from Qunshan.

07:44.420 --> 07:45.740
Once I was home,

07:46.320 --> 07:47.400
each morning started with Mom

07:47.440 --> 07:48.840
dragging me to Olympiad math class.

07:50.280 --> 07:52.100
Endless homework.

07:53.820 --> 07:55.280
I worked hard every day.

07:56.580 --> 07:57.760
I kept thinking,

07:57.800 --> 07:59.420
if I finished early,

07:59.460 --> 08:00.700
I could call you.

08:01.540 --> 08:02.780
I could go back and see you.

08:03.280 --> 08:05.320
But when I got home,

08:06.580 --> 08:08.100
I realized my mom had cut the phone line.

08:13.640 --> 08:15.100
That Spring Festival Eve,

08:15.140 --> 08:15.980
I begged her

08:16.020 --> 08:17.100
to let me make a phone call

08:17.140 --> 08:18.700
to Qunshan.

08:19.300 --> 08:20.200
But she said,

08:20.240 --> 08:21.340
after winter break,

08:22.760 --> 08:24.640
I would be transferred back
to Jialin Experimental.

09:01.700 --> 09:03.220
Jiang Qiaoxi!

09:03.260 --> 09:04.480
- Jiang Qiaoxi!
- Jiang Qiaoxi!

09:17.100 --> 09:20.260
JIALIN TO QUNSHAN

10:07.180 --> 10:08.020
Stop right there.

10:08.720 --> 10:09.640
Let's go.

10:09.680 --> 10:10.540
You're coming home.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.840
I bet it hurt a lot.

10:13.660 --> 10:15.080
You've got baby-soft skin.

10:16.660 --> 10:17.940
I'm kinda forgetting the pain.

10:18.480 --> 10:20.540
Nothing to worry.
I guess it didn't sting that much.

10:24.720 --> 10:25.560
What's wrong?

10:26.840 --> 10:28.460
You're unbelievable.

10:29.740 --> 10:31.280
You went through all that,

10:31.320 --> 10:32.900
and I had no idea.

10:32.940 --> 10:34.880
And here I was, blaming you all this time.

10:37.300 --> 10:38.320
If you'd just…

10:38.360 --> 10:39.440
If you'd just written back.

10:39.480 --> 10:40.860
Or called. Just once.

10:40.900 --> 10:42.600
So I'd know you hadn't forgotten me.

10:42.640 --> 10:44.160
That would've been enough.

10:50.500 --> 10:51.800
Let go of me!

10:51.840 --> 10:52.760
I'm going to Qunshan!

10:53.580 --> 10:55.240
How can you be so selfish?

10:55.740 --> 10:57.640
Your brother would never act like this.

10:57.680 --> 10:58.780
Jiang Qiaoxi,

10:58.820 --> 11:00.340
why are you like this?

11:06.160 --> 11:07.900
Because I'm Jiang Qiaoxi.

11:15.020 --> 11:16.540
If you dare reconnect

11:16.580 --> 11:17.920
with anyone from Qunshan,

11:18.960 --> 11:21.000
I'll make sure they all disappear
from your life.

11:23.520 --> 11:24.780
Try me.

12:04.500 --> 12:05.840
You're being quiet.

12:12.900 --> 12:14.420
I don't want to give you hope

12:14.460 --> 12:15.580
only to disappoint you again.

12:16.660 --> 12:17.500
I just want to give you

12:19.300 --> 12:20.380
a final answer.

12:20.420 --> 12:22.380
A final answer?

12:23.000 --> 12:24.180
Don't start throwing

12:24.220 --> 12:25.120
math metaphors at me.

12:26.140 --> 12:26.980
I won't.

12:27.620 --> 12:28.700
That winter,

12:29.220 --> 12:30.440
I promised I'd come back.

12:31.280 --> 12:32.380
And I didn't.

12:34.640 --> 12:36.360
I want to make sure I can follow through

12:36.400 --> 12:37.480
on everything I say to you.

12:39.020 --> 12:41.400
Like my cousin in Hong Kong.

12:41.440 --> 12:42.640
He treats his wife right.

12:43.660 --> 12:45.040
Every promise he's made her,

12:45.080 --> 12:46.160
he's kept.

12:50.460 --> 12:51.420
But I know

12:51.980 --> 12:53.360
I've got nothing right now.

12:54.640 --> 12:55.780
I'm stuck under my mom's thumb.

12:57.340 --> 12:58.400
You give everything

12:58.440 --> 12:59.900
when you care about someone.

13:00.520 --> 13:01.680
I don't want you

13:01.720 --> 13:03.160
to keep doing that for someone

13:03.880 --> 13:05.600
who can't even decide his own life yet.

13:08.380 --> 13:09.460
I felt just as helpless.

13:11.660 --> 13:12.520
I didn't even know

13:13.060 --> 13:14.380
what I could give you in return.

13:17.160 --> 13:18.820
Why bring up

13:18.860 --> 13:20.580
your cousin and his wife all of a sudden?

13:27.420 --> 13:28.460
Jiang Qiaoxi.

13:28.500 --> 13:30.040
Back then,

13:30.720 --> 13:32.780
I couldn't figure it out.

13:32.820 --> 13:34.500
Why you stopped writing.

13:34.540 --> 13:36.120
Why you never called.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.140
Why

13:37.180 --> 13:38.320
you just disappeared.

13:39.280 --> 13:40.620
I was never asking you

13:40.660 --> 13:41.920
to give me anything.

13:42.500 --> 13:43.820
I just wanted to hear from you.

13:43.860 --> 13:45.300
To know how you were doing.

13:46.500 --> 13:47.340
I knew that.

13:47.980 --> 13:49.500
I wanted to reach out too.

13:50.500 --> 13:51.940
But even if I had,

13:51.980 --> 13:53.560
it wouldn't have helped.

13:54.680 --> 13:56.160
It would've made things harder for you.

13:59.980 --> 14:01.160
Then what about now?

14:02.500 --> 14:03.680
Now you're

14:03.720 --> 14:05.040
showing up for me,

14:05.080 --> 14:06.200
even chasing after the bus.

14:06.860 --> 14:08.920
Clearly, you've been trying
to get close to me.

14:08.960 --> 14:10.400
Isn't that contradictory?

14:10.440 --> 14:11.360
It's not.

14:12.100 --> 14:13.060
Now there's a variable.

14:15.500 --> 14:17.340
I didn't expect you to come find me.

14:17.380 --> 14:19.000
Didn't expect you to pass out
from the heat.

14:20.140 --> 14:21.400
I definitely didn't expect you

14:21.980 --> 14:23.580
to think I was with Cen Xiaoman.

14:27.200 --> 14:28.320
So it's my fault now?

14:29.440 --> 14:30.280
My fault.

14:30.320 --> 14:31.160
Heart over head.

14:34.240 --> 14:35.080
Here we are.

14:35.780 --> 14:36.620
Watch your step.

15:07.760 --> 15:09.420
Does that clear things up?

15:13.560 --> 15:14.440
Well,

15:15.320 --> 15:16.380
if you're wondering

15:16.420 --> 15:17.680
whether I've forgiven you,

15:18.640 --> 15:19.900
I haven't decided yet.

15:38.220 --> 15:39.140
So yeah,

15:39.180 --> 15:40.020
that's the story.

15:40.960 --> 15:42.980
So it was his mom
who didn't want him hanging with us.

15:44.380 --> 15:45.960
At least he still has some conscience.

15:46.000 --> 15:47.720
I've always thought Jiang Qiaoxi

15:47.760 --> 15:48.760
wasn't the heartless type.

15:49.640 --> 15:50.900
Just a coward

15:50.940 --> 15:52.460
with some conscience.

15:52.500 --> 15:54.080
Coward?

15:54.120 --> 15:55.820
You don't even know
what his family is like.

15:56.520 --> 15:58.400
That's a fast turnaround.

15:58.440 --> 16:00.320
You just found out,
and you're already on his side?

16:07.600 --> 16:08.760
Yu Qiao.

16:09.480 --> 16:11.160
- Yu Qiao, what are you smiling at?
- Eh?

16:12.040 --> 16:13.200
What?

16:13.240 --> 16:14.580
Why are you grinning like that?

16:14.620 --> 16:16.560
You look happier than Lin Yingtao.

16:17.060 --> 16:18.940
You and Jiang Qiaoxi close or something?

16:18.980 --> 16:20.160
- I…
- And by the way,

16:20.880 --> 16:22.000
your laugh is horrendous.

16:23.180 --> 16:24.380
It's not like that.

16:24.420 --> 16:26.600
I just remembered this joke.

16:26.640 --> 16:28.300
It was really, really funny.

16:28.340 --> 16:29.480
Let's hear it then.

16:31.300 --> 16:32.180
Okay.

16:32.220 --> 16:33.060
One day,

16:33.100 --> 16:34.340
a steamed bun got into a fight

16:34.380 --> 16:36.380
with a noodle and totally beat him.

16:36.420 --> 16:37.420
The next day,

16:37.460 --> 16:39.420
the noodle came back
with his buddy, Instant Noodles.

16:39.460 --> 16:40.340
But the bun just said,

16:40.380 --> 16:42.060
"You think I won't recognize you

16:42.100 --> 16:43.060
just because

16:43.100 --> 16:43.940
you've got curls?

16:43.980 --> 16:44.820
I'll still hit you."

16:53.700 --> 16:55.040
I agree. That's hilarious.

17:21.000 --> 17:22.220
Jiang Qiaoxi!

17:22.260 --> 17:24.079
What are you doing? Stop shouting.

17:35.620 --> 17:37.480
I still need to talk to Jiang Qiaoxi

17:37.520 --> 17:38.920
about how we'll act around each other.

17:38.960 --> 17:40.160
We need to make a plan.

17:41.360 --> 17:42.440
Yeah.

17:42.480 --> 17:44.400
After all that drama,

17:44.440 --> 17:46.860
suddenly we're just friends
with him again?

17:46.900 --> 17:48.500
His mom's gonna lose it

17:49.020 --> 17:50.120
if she finds out.

17:52.340 --> 17:53.780
Heard from my dad

17:53.820 --> 17:55.340
she's still at the Laishui site.

17:55.380 --> 17:56.720
Hasn't come back yet.

17:56.760 --> 17:57.600
Then…

17:59.340 --> 18:00.180
Hey,

18:00.220 --> 18:01.060
maybe tonight?

18:05.900 --> 18:06.900
You guys figure it out.

18:09.140 --> 18:10.060
Qin Yeyun.

18:12.160 --> 18:13.180
What's up with you?

18:14.020 --> 18:16.800
Hey, from now on,

18:16.840 --> 18:18.000
you're eating lunch with us.

18:18.040 --> 18:19.080
Just like today.

18:21.000 --> 18:21.880
Boring.

18:21.920 --> 18:23.440
Who said I want to eat with you?

18:23.480 --> 18:25.300
Boring? You were laughing your head off.

18:28.620 --> 18:29.760
Yu Qiao.

18:29.800 --> 18:31.260
Your job now

18:31.300 --> 18:33.000
is telling her one joke every lunch.

18:33.040 --> 18:34.520
You two clearly share the same

18:34.560 --> 18:35.920
weird sense of humor.

19:37.820 --> 19:38.660
Jiang Qiaoxi,

19:39.160 --> 19:40.000
can I ask something?

19:41.600 --> 19:43.440
Do you know how to do this question?

19:47.180 --> 19:48.360
- This one…
- Hey, look.

19:49.440 --> 19:51.880
- Yu Qiao is asking Jiang Qiaoxi for help.
- I noticed.

19:51.920 --> 19:53.020
ASKING FOR YINGTAO: MEET TONIGHT?
11 PM, AT THE GARDEN?

19:53.060 --> 19:55.840
So this has two cases,
positive and negative. Work through both

19:56.380 --> 19:57.800
and solve the equations.

19:59.060 --> 20:00.000
I'll write out an example.

20:01.400 --> 20:04.060
SURE!

20:11.060 --> 20:12.900
That's it there. You get it?

20:12.940 --> 20:14.080
Yeah.

20:14.120 --> 20:15.720
This is actually really clear.

21:00.960 --> 21:03.620
JIALIN CITY POWER CONSTRUCTION
HOUSING COMPOUND

22:18.640 --> 22:20.000
What's in your hand?

22:27.920 --> 22:29.220
I'm listening to music.

22:30.520 --> 22:31.740
And the other hand?

22:44.300 --> 22:45.140
My diary.

22:52.960 --> 22:55.380
Let me guess.

22:55.420 --> 22:57.000
It's all about Jiang Qiaoxi?

22:57.860 --> 22:59.080
What else? You?

22:59.620 --> 23:00.820
You ever heard of subtlety?

23:00.860 --> 23:02.160
Subtlety? What for?

23:03.100 --> 23:05.800
Why can't you keep a little mystery?

23:05.840 --> 23:07.220
You lay it all out like that,

23:07.260 --> 23:08.300
and you lose the upper hand.

23:10.540 --> 23:11.620
You don't understand.

23:12.220 --> 23:13.780
I just wanted him to know

23:13.820 --> 23:15.200
when he was thinking of me…

23:16.360 --> 23:17.200
of us,

23:17.720 --> 23:19.640
I was thinking of

23:20.480 --> 23:21.320
us too?

23:23.260 --> 23:25.320
All of us were thinking of him too.

23:25.360 --> 23:27.640
- I…
- But is it really us and we?

23:27.680 --> 23:28.820
Or did you mean

23:28.860 --> 23:30.640
when he was thinking of you,

23:30.680 --> 23:31.740
you were thinking of him?

23:38.540 --> 23:39.380
I should go.

23:53.220 --> 23:54.060
Hey,

23:54.100 --> 23:55.960
how do I look?

24:09.420 --> 24:10.300
Isn't it

24:10.340 --> 24:11.180
too short like this?

24:11.220 --> 24:12.620
Nope. Trust me,

24:12.660 --> 24:13.560
this is much better.

24:17.320 --> 24:19.180
- It's too much. I feel exposed.
- It looks good.

24:19.220 --> 24:20.940
- My stomach is showing.
- Just leave it.

24:23.340 --> 24:24.420
No tugging it down, okay?

24:36.100 --> 24:38.080
Who's still out playing ball this late?

24:39.240 --> 24:40.300
Who cares?

24:40.340 --> 24:41.360
Probably some idiot.

24:41.400 --> 24:42.360
Who?

24:46.640 --> 24:47.480
So are you

24:47.520 --> 24:48.980
going to see Jiang Qiaoxi or what?

25:29.100 --> 25:29.940
Yu Qiao!

25:35.020 --> 25:36.260
What are you doing out here?

25:36.300 --> 25:37.600
Isn't it past your bedtime?

25:43.340 --> 25:45.200
Couldn't sleep. Figured I'd walk a bit.

25:45.240 --> 25:46.540
Didn't think I'd run into you.

25:49.660 --> 25:51.560
Roaming around in the middle of the night,

25:51.600 --> 25:52.600
all dressed up?

25:56.920 --> 25:57.860
Are you dating someone?

26:02.780 --> 26:04.380
Your jokes really suck.

26:04.920 --> 26:07.380
You laughed at mine this afternoon though.

26:12.140 --> 26:13.500
Are you feeling the same

26:15.000 --> 26:16.400
about my joke?

26:20.880 --> 26:21.720
It wasn't funny.

26:23.020 --> 26:24.420
Not funny, but you laughed?

26:27.140 --> 26:27.980
Well,

26:28.020 --> 26:29.260
now you are kind of funny.

26:34.320 --> 26:35.580
I think so too.

26:44.080 --> 26:44.960
Then

26:45.000 --> 26:46.540
what were you laughing at?

26:51.280 --> 26:52.540
I was laughing at you.

26:56.120 --> 26:56.960
Really?

26:59.220 --> 27:00.620
Yeah, I think I'm funny too.

28:32.920 --> 28:34.460
I told you a hundred times,

28:35.100 --> 28:36.200
red's not your color.

28:40.920 --> 28:41.880
I like red.

28:42.380 --> 28:43.660
You're still young.

28:45.420 --> 28:47.420
You don't know what you actually like yet.

28:48.040 --> 28:49.580
You think I'm that clueless?

28:51.340 --> 28:53.100
That I don't even know what I like?

28:53.140 --> 28:55.340
You're trying to pick a fight

28:55.380 --> 28:56.220
over this?

29:04.900 --> 29:06.820
I've only been gone
a few days on business,

29:06.860 --> 29:07.840
and you're already at it.

29:07.880 --> 29:09.600
Can't you give me one break?

29:21.420 --> 29:22.760
Was it really a work trip…

29:25.020 --> 29:26.740
or did you visit your perfect son's grave?

29:29.220 --> 29:30.780
Every time I do well in school,

29:31.660 --> 29:32.980
you run to tell that son of yours,

29:33.020 --> 29:34.800
the one I've never even met.

29:37.640 --> 29:38.500
You want my good grades

29:38.540 --> 29:39.400
to be his, right?

29:44.400 --> 29:45.260
I also wish he could…

29:47.460 --> 29:49.060
be the son you actually wanted.

29:51.660 --> 29:53.180
If you're going there…

29:59.140 --> 30:01.360
I swear I'll go straight to
Lin Haifeng's house

30:01.400 --> 30:03.360
and ask them
how they raise their daughter.

30:06.240 --> 30:08.820
Sneaking out to meet a boy late at night?

30:10.100 --> 30:11.280
They deserve to know

30:12.280 --> 30:14.100
how off-track their family's gotten.

30:14.140 --> 30:15.660
What's messed up is our family.

30:19.840 --> 30:21.100
A site in Fujian

30:21.140 --> 30:22.520
is looking for engineers.

30:24.860 --> 30:26.540
Why don't we let them go
where they belong,

30:27.420 --> 30:29.300
and you go where you belong?

30:30.180 --> 30:31.260
Problem solved.

30:44.200 --> 30:45.980
You don't think I'll ever grow up?

30:47.040 --> 30:49.300
That you'll always be able to control me?

30:51.020 --> 30:53.000
Of course I want you to grow up.

30:55.020 --> 30:56.240
Because only then

30:57.440 --> 30:59.380
will you understand
everything I've done for you.

31:03.720 --> 31:04.580
I'm tired.

31:06.200 --> 31:07.160
I'm done

31:07.200 --> 31:08.500
explaining myself.

31:39.320 --> 31:40.320
Pack your things.

31:40.360 --> 31:42.340
You're going to the training camp tonight.

31:42.380 --> 31:43.860
No more distractions.

31:43.900 --> 31:45.280
Math has to be your priority.

31:46.560 --> 31:47.720
I'm not going.

31:47.760 --> 31:48.740
I have school tomorrow.

31:50.440 --> 31:51.520
Jiang Qiaoxi!

31:54.140 --> 31:55.900
I could hear you from outside.

31:55.940 --> 31:57.720
Why are you yelling at Qiaoxi?

31:57.760 --> 31:58.860
What is it this time?

31:58.900 --> 31:59.800
What now?

32:01.220 --> 32:02.880
If you hadn't taken him to Qunshan

32:02.920 --> 32:04.040
for your promotion,

32:04.080 --> 32:05.820
he wouldn't have turned out like this.

32:06.960 --> 32:07.940
Liang Hongfei,

32:07.980 --> 32:09.080
why are you digging this up

32:09.120 --> 32:10.160
again?

32:10.200 --> 32:12.020
Now it's a problem

32:12.060 --> 32:13.660
I'm trying to parent?

32:13.700 --> 32:15.520
When he was little,

32:15.560 --> 32:17.440
you wanted nothing to do with him.

32:18.260 --> 32:19.840
I had a job.

32:19.880 --> 32:21.020
What else could I do

32:21.060 --> 32:22.000
but take him with me?

32:22.040 --> 32:23.300
Don't act like I didn't care.

32:23.340 --> 32:24.800
I worked too.

32:24.840 --> 32:26.860
That's why I had to
bring him to Qunshan, remember?

32:28.880 --> 32:29.720
- This one.
- Right.

32:30.360 --> 32:31.980
Look at that smile.

32:32.020 --> 32:33.800
Her smile really lights up a room.

32:34.640 --> 32:37.380
Let's put that over there.

32:37.960 --> 32:38.800
Since Qiaoxi

32:38.840 --> 32:40.380
switched schools in fifth grade,

32:40.420 --> 32:41.340
we haven't seen

32:41.380 --> 32:43.240
Yingtao smile like that.

32:43.820 --> 32:44.800
Tonight,

32:44.840 --> 32:46.140
when she brought him up,

32:46.840 --> 32:48.840
she really looked like

32:48.880 --> 32:50.700
the little girl she used to be.

32:50.740 --> 32:51.700
You actually agreed?

32:51.740 --> 32:53.780
I though you weren't going to let her go.

32:54.740 --> 32:56.360
But now look, it's this late,

32:56.400 --> 32:57.620
and she still isn't home.

32:57.660 --> 32:58.640
That girl…

32:59.220 --> 33:00.480
You know,

33:00.520 --> 33:02.000
even if you'd stopped her,

33:02.040 --> 33:03.880
she would've found a way to go.

33:04.660 --> 33:05.740
And honestly,

33:05.780 --> 33:06.620
if she really

33:06.660 --> 33:08.220
had something on her mind,

33:08.260 --> 33:09.880
she wouldn't tell us anyway.

33:11.460 --> 33:13.720
At their age, friendships like this

33:13.760 --> 33:15.160
are the purest.

33:15.200 --> 33:16.760
They deserve to be protected.

33:17.760 --> 33:18.600
Yeah.

33:24.160 --> 33:26.120
Who is it this late?

33:30.560 --> 33:31.520
Cai.

33:32.900 --> 33:33.740
Hello, Manager Cai.

33:34.900 --> 33:35.780
Is something wrong?

33:35.820 --> 33:36.860
Lin,

33:36.900 --> 33:38.580
Mr. Jiang and Mrs. Liang
are fighting again.

33:38.620 --> 33:40.240
The whole compound can hear it.

33:40.280 --> 33:41.340
Apparently,

33:41.380 --> 33:42.800
it's about Yingtao and Qiaoxi.

33:44.160 --> 33:45.040
What?

33:45.080 --> 33:46.400
You've been a father twice.

33:46.440 --> 33:47.940
Not once did you get it right.

33:47.980 --> 33:48.920
Are you really planning

33:48.960 --> 33:50.340
to ruin both kids?

33:50.380 --> 33:52.380
This happened over ten years ago.

33:52.420 --> 33:53.480
You're still clinging to it?

33:53.520 --> 33:54.900
What do you want from me?

33:54.940 --> 33:55.800
What do I want?

33:55.840 --> 33:56.940
- What I want?
- What do you want from me?

33:56.980 --> 33:58.320
You keep using it

33:58.360 --> 33:59.200
to punish me.

33:59.240 --> 34:00.640
Tearing open old wounds.

34:00.680 --> 34:02.300
If I gave my life to Mengchu,

34:02.340 --> 34:03.300
would that

34:03.340 --> 34:04.180
make it right?

34:04.220 --> 34:06.160
- Would it be over then?
- Auntie Juan.

34:06.200 --> 34:08.300
No one in this world
can pay for my son's life.

34:08.840 --> 34:10.800
Can you keep Jiang Qiaoxi in check?

34:10.840 --> 34:12.219
Lin Haifeng's daughter

34:12.260 --> 34:13.500
is sneaking out at night

34:13.540 --> 34:14.699
to meet your son.

34:14.739 --> 34:16.300
If you still consider yourself his father,

34:16.340 --> 34:17.620
go to their house

34:17.659 --> 34:18.699
and tell them

34:18.739 --> 34:21.040
to keep their daughter away from my son.

34:21.080 --> 34:22.840
- You want that?
- You want to lose it? Go ahead.

34:22.880 --> 34:24.219
I'm not going crazy with you.

34:57.840 --> 34:59.260
Why are you here?

35:00.600 --> 35:01.440
I…

35:02.840 --> 35:03.820
I was just passing by.

35:04.800 --> 35:05.640
And I saw you

35:06.380 --> 35:07.340
standing here alone.

35:08.720 --> 35:10.720
Jiang Qiaoxi still hasn't come.

35:10.760 --> 35:12.660
Are you sure you gave him the right time?

35:12.700 --> 35:14.180
I gave him the exact time.

35:15.960 --> 35:17.460
He's still not here.

35:17.500 --> 35:18.460
And it's late.

35:18.500 --> 35:19.340
Well…

35:20.280 --> 35:21.460
Look.

35:21.500 --> 35:23.260
Go home. We can talk about it tomorrow.

35:24.500 --> 35:26.040
Come on, I'll walk you home.

35:57.080 --> 35:58.020
Qiaoxi.

35:58.060 --> 35:59.760
Uncle, Auntie, I'm sorry.

35:59.800 --> 36:00.900
This was my fault.

36:01.660 --> 36:03.160
I asked Yingtao to meet me.

36:05.280 --> 36:07.000
I was going to tell her something,

36:07.040 --> 36:08.220
but I can't make it.

36:09.400 --> 36:10.480
Please,

36:10.520 --> 36:11.540
tell her I'm sorry.

36:11.580 --> 36:12.700
Jiang Qiaoxi.

36:13.740 --> 36:14.620
I'm heading

36:15.140 --> 36:16.340
to Olympiad camp tonight.

36:17.940 --> 36:18.960
Well,

36:19.880 --> 36:21.060
Lin, Shengjuan,

36:21.100 --> 36:22.860
kids seeing each other after school,

36:23.400 --> 36:25.560
chatting and hanging out, is normal.

36:27.780 --> 36:28.680
Sorry we made you come

36:28.720 --> 36:30.880
all the way out here

36:30.920 --> 36:31.960
because of our family's mess.

36:32.000 --> 36:33.580
Is it just our family issue?

36:39.580 --> 36:40.420
Mom,

36:41.520 --> 36:42.420
let's just go.

36:43.200 --> 36:44.640
I promised you.

36:46.520 --> 36:47.520
I'll keep my word.

36:49.480 --> 36:50.960
I'll believe you this one last time.

37:08.460 --> 37:09.300
Yingtao.

37:12.780 --> 37:13.760
Yingtao, Yingtao…

37:13.800 --> 37:14.640
Don't go, Yingtao!

37:14.680 --> 37:15.640
Yingtao.

37:17.000 --> 37:17.840
Yingtao.

37:19.800 --> 37:22.040
Heard it was because
he was seeing Yingtao.

37:22.080 --> 37:25.200
That's why things got messy.

37:35.220 --> 37:36.140
Mom.

37:37.000 --> 37:39.060
Auntie Juan, Uncle Haifeng,

37:39.100 --> 37:41.380
Yingtao didn't do anything wrong.
She didn't.

37:45.160 --> 37:46.000
Thanks.

37:46.760 --> 37:49.080
Yu Qiao, it's late.

37:50.380 --> 37:51.220
Head on home.

37:52.460 --> 37:53.380
Get back safe.

38:04.120 --> 38:05.300
Sorry.

38:06.160 --> 38:07.000
I…

38:08.020 --> 38:08.900
It's okay.

38:10.500 --> 38:11.360
Don't worry.

38:12.120 --> 38:13.900
Mom and Dad don't think
you did anything wrong.

38:17.580 --> 38:18.420
Let's go home.

38:20.960 --> 38:21.960
Come on.

38:22.580 --> 38:23.740
Come on. Let's go home.

38:31.000 --> 38:32.500
It's cooling down lately, huh?

38:33.360 --> 38:34.280
Right?

38:34.320 --> 38:35.160
Autumn's coming.

38:37.160 --> 38:39.280
I'll make you some pear water
with rock sugar.

38:39.320 --> 38:40.740
Bring it to school with you, okay?

38:44.040 --> 38:44.880
Mom.

38:46.720 --> 38:47.900
Did Jiang Qiaoxi's mom

38:47.940 --> 38:48.960
say anything nasty

38:49.000 --> 38:50.320
to you and Dad?

38:52.360 --> 38:53.200
Yingtao,

38:53.880 --> 38:55.420
don't forget who your dad is.

38:56.020 --> 38:57.800
I'm the top electrician in the unit.

38:59.880 --> 39:01.240
No matter how high up

39:01.280 --> 39:02.580
she is,

39:02.620 --> 39:04.280
she'll still treat me

39:04.320 --> 39:05.980
with polite.

39:07.080 --> 39:07.920
Am I right?

39:09.400 --> 39:10.440
But I brought you all

39:10.480 --> 39:12.220
so much trouble.

39:13.240 --> 39:14.880
Someday

39:14.920 --> 39:16.260
when you're a parent,

39:16.300 --> 39:17.400
you'll understand.

39:18.000 --> 39:19.420
Kids grow up

39:19.460 --> 39:21.180
through all kinds of trouble.

39:35.980 --> 39:36.820
Well…

39:38.460 --> 39:40.840
Is… I mean…

39:40.880 --> 39:42.220
Is Jiang Qiaoxi in trouble?

39:44.760 --> 39:45.600
Yingtao,

39:46.320 --> 39:47.860
Qiaoxi's a good kid.

39:48.420 --> 39:49.580
Just like you,

39:49.620 --> 39:51.580
he cares deeply about what you two have.

39:52.500 --> 39:53.880
But a lot of the time,

39:54.380 --> 39:55.520
especially like you,

39:55.560 --> 39:56.700
at your age,

39:57.240 --> 39:59.220
it's hard to change things around you.

39:59.260 --> 40:01.180
Hard to make choices all on your own.

40:43.960 --> 40:44.940
It's true

40:46.260 --> 40:47.100
we can't always

40:47.140 --> 40:48.640
change things around us.

40:50.680 --> 40:52.580
But friendship is around us.

40:54.060 --> 40:55.940
It is something hard to change,

40:56.780 --> 40:57.780
right?

41:00.600 --> 41:01.440
Of course.

41:11.360 --> 41:12.200
Let's go.

41:37.780 --> 41:41.580
GENERAL GOODS

41:46.620 --> 41:47.460
Yun.

41:48.220 --> 41:49.060
Uncle Jiang.

41:49.800 --> 41:50.840
Grab me a pack of cigarettes.

41:54.880 --> 41:58.120
QIN FAMILY MART

42:05.900 --> 42:07.720
Need anything else?

42:21.620 --> 42:22.460
Yun…

42:24.860 --> 42:27.060
you're close with Yingtao, right?

42:28.260 --> 42:29.700
Could you

42:29.740 --> 42:31.020
maybe talk to her?

42:32.840 --> 42:34.500
Right now,

42:35.280 --> 42:37.600
your top priority is studying.

42:40.820 --> 42:42.120
But besides that,

42:42.160 --> 42:43.740
it's also important

42:43.780 --> 42:45.240
to build healthy relationships.

42:46.900 --> 42:48.340
That includes friendships.

42:49.680 --> 42:51.140
That's to say.

42:51.180 --> 42:52.340
Something can wait.

42:52.380 --> 42:53.220
For example, romance.

42:55.600 --> 42:57.540
All of that needs to happen
at the right time.

42:58.820 --> 43:00.040
At their age,

43:00.600 --> 43:02.880
it's best for them to
not affecting one another.

43:05.220 --> 43:06.100
Uncle Jiang,

43:07.040 --> 43:08.320
if you ask me,

43:08.860 --> 43:10.800
it's Jiang Qiaoxi
who's been affecting Lin Yingtao.

45:44.200 --> 45:46.860
Subtitle translation by: Jiaxin Wang
